   "info": "The hostel on the waterfront by Santa Cruz La Laguna's dock, an oasis on the shore for over twenty years: three dorms and rooms up the slope over the lake, the bar and the family-style dinner at seven, and ATI Divers, for two decades the only dive shop on Lake Atitlán, working from its jetty. Santa Cruz has no road to the shore: everyone comes by lancha."
